      "name": "Ingest",
      "description": "Vendor CSV with header `sku,name,category,cost,stock_quantity`. Generate one with `npm run ingest:generate -- --rows 20000 --out data/vendor.csv` and start the worker with `npm run worker` in a second terminal.\n\nPick the file in the `file` form field before sending (Postman only stores file paths per machine).",
